{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "按链定确认",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 67.34,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "按角色，各做一件事。",
   "spoken": "按决色，各做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-00.wav",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 1.694,
   "speechEnd": 3.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "交易所，每条链单独定入账条件。",
   "spoken": "交易所，每条链单独定入账条件。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-01.wav",
   "start": 3.98,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speechStart": 3.98,
   "speechEnd": 7.122
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "以太坊看 finalized 标签，PoW 小链按租算力的成本定确认数。",
   "spoken": "以太坊看 finalized 标签，PoW 小链按租算力的成本定确认数。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-02.wav",
   "start": 7.48,
   "dur": 6.16,
   "speechStart": 7.57,
   "speechEnd": 13.437
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "区分两种状态，继续出块但不最终确定，和完全停止。",
   "spoken": "区分两种状态，继续出块但不最终确定，和完全停止。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-03.wav",
   "start": 13.86,
   "dur": 5.36,
   "speechStart": 13.86,
   "speechEnd": 19.023
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "最终性延迟或出块间隔超过阈值，自动暂停充提，恢复后逐笔对账。",
   "spoken": "最终性延迟或出块间隔超过阈值，自动暂停充提，恢复后逐笔对账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-04.wav",
   "start": 19.44,
   "dur": 6.32,
   "speechStart": 19.44,
   "speechEnd": 25.53
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "运营节点的，至少运行两种客户端，交叉核对。",
   "spoken": "运营节点的，至少运行两种客户端，交叉核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-05.wav",
   "start": 25.98,
   "dur": 4.0,
   "speechStart": 25.98,
   "speechEnd": 29.746
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "普通用户，交易所显示等待确认时，耐心等。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，交易所显示等待确认时，耐心等。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-06.wav",
   "start": 30.2,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 30.2,
   "speechEnd": 34.056
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "链停摆时，不要反复提交交易，恢复后先查状态。",
   "spoken": "链停摆时，不要反复提交交易，恢复后先查状态。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-07.wav",
   "start": 34.5,
   "dur": 4.4,
   "speechStart": 34.591,
   "speechEnd": 38.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-08.wav",
   "start": 39.12,
   "dur": 1.28,
   "speechStart": 39.12,
   "speechEnd": 40.272
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "同样的 bug 出在超过三分之一的客户端上，检查点不再最终确定。",
   "spoken": "同样的 bug 出在超过三分之一的客户端上，检查点不再最终确定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-09.wav",
   "start": 40.62,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 40.715,
   "speechEnd": 45.927
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "链照样出块，N 个区块的条件照样满足，系统继续入账。",
   "spoken": "链照样出块，N 个区块的条件照样满足，系统继续入账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-10.wav",
   "start": 46.36,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 46.451,
   "speechEnd": 50.951
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "只有看 finalized 标签、监控最终性延迟的系统，才会停下。",
   "spoken": "只有看 finalized 标签、监控最终性延迟的系统，才会停下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-11.wav",
   "start": 51.38,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 51.478,
   "speechEnd": 55.944
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "已确认只是一个赌注，先问攻击者控制了什么，再定防线。",
   "spoken": "已确认只是一个赌注，先问攻击者控制了什么，再定防线。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-12.wav",
   "start": 56.4,
   "dur": 4.8,
   "speechStart": 56.495,
   "speechEnd": 60.988
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "下一集讲节点、RPC 与验证者基础设施的安全。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲节点、RPC 与验证者基础设施的安全。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep16/audio/lines/seg6-13.wav",
   "start": 61.42,
